	"data": "Godot Editor on Quest 3\n\nThe Godot editor runs natively on Quest 3 and Quest Pro via the Meta Horizon Store.\nStore: <https://www.meta.com/experiences/godot-game-engine/7713660705416473/>\nLicense: MIT (Godot engine)\nStatus: Live, early access\nBuilt by: Fredia Huya-Kouadio (Meta), W4 Games, Bastiaan Olij\n\nWhat It Provides\nFull Godot editor on the headset — GDScript editing with code completion\nLive scene editing, live script reloading, live debugging, live profiling\nBluetooth keyboard + mouse…",
